mpleted":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**Describe the bug**\r\nglibmmconfig.h is missing.\r\n\r\n**Environment**\r\n- OS: Windows 10 20H2\r\n- Compiler: Visual Studio 2019 16.10.3\r\n\r\n**To Reproduce**\r\n\r\n1. ./vcpkg install cairo cairomm pango pangomm\r\n\r\n1. Set External Include Directory project setting to `$(VCPkgRoot)\\installed\\$(LibrariesArchitecture)-windows\\include\\sigc++-3.0;$(VCPkgRoot)\\installed\\$(LibrariesArchitecture)-windows\\include\\giomm-2.68;$(VCPkgRoot)\\installed\\$(LibrariesArchitecture)-windows\\include\\glibmm-2.68;$(VCPkgRoot)\\installed\\$(LibrariesArchitecture)-windows\\include\\cairomm-1.16;$(VCPkgRoot)\\installed\\$(LibrariesArchitecture)-windows\\include\\pangomm-2.48;$(ExternalIncludePath)`\r\n\r\n1. Compile the code below.\r\n`#include <glibmm.h>`\r\n\r\n**Expected behavior**\r\nNo error.\r\n\r\n**Failure logs** \r\n`C:\\work\\Project\\vcpkg\\installed\\x64-windows\\include\\glibmm-2.68\\glibmm.h(96,10): fatal error C1083: include ファイルを開けません。'glibmmconfig.h':No such file or directory`\r\n\r\n**Additional context**\r\n`#include <pangomm.h>` emits the same error.\r\nSee #18760 for the External Include Directory project setting above.","closed_by":{"login":"BillyONeal","id":1544943,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NDQ5NDM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1544943?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BillyONeal","html_url":"https://github.com/BillyONeal","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BillyONeal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BillyONeal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BillyONeal/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BillyONeal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BillyONeal/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BillyONeal/orgs","repos_